# BuildKit reads this next to worker/Dockerfile (Dockerfile-specific ignore file). Build context = the repo root.
# Whitelist: only common/{s2s_token.py,session.py,data/records_v4.json} and worker/ (minus the dirs below) are sent.
*
!common/s2s_token.py
!common/session.py
!common/data/records_v4.json
!worker/
worker/local/
worker/tests/
worker/tools/
worker/build/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venvs/
